1997 edition"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"source_label","html":"§4 proof length"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"33"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"44"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本次检查定义接口、依赖与陈述形式；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"inherited_verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"inherited_source_proof_status","html":"陈述及下述本地推导已复核；未作机器证明"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 为带 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a329235da6144513\" href=\"?note=a329235da6144513\" title=\"67-df-strong-godel-encoding\">67-df-strong-godel-encoding</a> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g=c_L\">\\(g=c_L\\)</span> 的有效签名；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span> 固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"189f5355af0e487c\" href=\"?note=189f5355af0e487c\" title=\"67-df-certified-proof\">67-df-certified-proof</a> 的有效呈示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_T\">\\(E_T\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Proof}_T(p,n)\">\\(\\mathrm{Proof}_T(p,n)\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"be38aee184dd1b06\" href=\"?note=be38aee184dd1b06\" title=\"67-df-proof-predicate\">67-df-proof-predicate</a> 的外部证明码关系；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,k,p,q\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n,k,p,q\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell_T\">\\(\\ell_T\\)</span> 是下式定义的部分函数。这里的度量是所选编号下最小的证明代码，不声称等于证明的符号个数；该定义不需要内部算术表示。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ProofLength}_T(n,k)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Proof}_T(k,n)\\land\n\\forall q&lt;k\\ \\neg\\mathrm{Proof}_T(q,n),\\\\\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\ell_T)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{n\\in\\mathbb N:\\exists p\\ \\mathrm{Proof}_T(p,n)\\},\\\\\n\\ell_T(n)=k&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{ProofLength}_T(n,k).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ProofLength}_T(n,k)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Proof}_T(k,n)\\land\n\\forall q&lt;k\\ \\neg\\mathrm{Proof}_T(q,n),\\\\\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\ell_T)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{n\\in\\mathbb N:\\exists p\\ \\mathrm{Proof}_T(p,n)\\},\\\\\n\\ell_T(n)=k&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{ProofLength}_T(n,k).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本节保留的原书页码、既往核对记录及证明说明来自输入档案；本次未提供原书 PDF，以下既往记录不表示本次重新完成了来源或证明核验。</p>\n<p>原书 p.33 明确用证明的 Gödel 编码本身衡量长度，并说明可改用符号出现数。旧条目改成编码的二进制尺寸，使书中定理变成另一度量的变体；现恢复原书度量。可证明码集合上由自然数良序得到存在唯一最小值，未证明句子的 ℓ_T 没有值。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-proof-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"be38aee184dd1b06","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-proof-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-strong-godel-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"a329235da6144513","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-strong-godel-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-certified-proof","status":"resolved","id":"189f5355af0e487c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-certified-proof]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-strong-godel-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"a329235da6144513","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ 为带 [[67-df-strong-godel-encoding]] 中 $g=c_L$ 的有效签名；$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$ 固定 [[67-df-certified-proof]] 的有效呈示 $E_T$。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-certified-proof","status":"resolved","id":"189f5355af0e487c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ 为带 [[67-df-strong-godel-encoding]] 中 $g=c_L$ 的有效签名；$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$ 固定 [[67-df-certified-proof]] 的有效呈示 $E_T$。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-proof-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"be38aee184dd1b06","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Proof}_T(p,n)$ 是 [[67-df-proof-predicate]] 的外部证明码关系；$n,k,p,q\\in\\mathbb N$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"g=c_L","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L","display":false},{"tex":"E_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Proof}_T(p,n)","display":false},{"tex":"n,k,p,q\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ProofLength}_T(n,k)&\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Proof}_T(k,n)\\land\n\\forall q<k\\ \\neg\\mathrm{Proof}_T(q,n),\\\\\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\ell_T)&\\coloneqq\\{n\\in\\mathbb N:\\exists p\\ \\mathrm{Proof}_T(p,n)\\},\\\\\n\\ell_T(n)=k&\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{ProofLength}_T(n,k).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2207,"backlinks":[{"id":"83d3bbcffd824285","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\ell_T$ 与 $\\mathrm{ProofLength}_T$ 见 [[67-df-proof-length]]；$\\mathrm{Rec}_1$ 见 [[67-df-recursive-function-class]]，$\\Pi_1$ 见 [[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]。"},{"id":"7cb4b381ccf9d5bd","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T+\\alpha=T\\cup\\{\\alpha\\}$ 使用同一演算及自然证明编号；$\\mathrm{Proof}$ 与 $\\ell_T$ 见 [[67-df-proof-predicate]]、[[67-df-proof-length]]，$\\mathrm{Rec}_1$ 见 [[67-df-recursive-function-class]]。"},{"id":"38502195e450dd58","anchor":"ref-41","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-proof-length]]"},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-68","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-proof-length]]"}],"outgoing":["be38aee184dd1b06","a329235da6144513","189f5355af0e487c"]}